  "document": "Robinne Lee\nRobinne Lee (born July 16, 1974) is an American actress and author ab. She made her screen debut in the 1997 independent film \"Hav Plenty\", and later has appeared in films \"National Security\" (2003), \"Deliver Us from Eva\" (2003), \"Hitch\" (2005), \"Seven Pounds\" (2008), \"Fifty Shades Darker\" (2017), and the upcoming \"Fifty Shades Freed\". Her first novel will be released by St Martin's Press in June 2017."
